# Coalstoke Gearhulk: when it enters it puts a creature card with mana value 4 or less from a graveyard onto the battlefield
# under your control with a finality counter, and that creature gains menace, deathtouch and haste (Hill Giant has none of
# them and attacks the turn it arrives, for 3), and it is exiled at the beginning of your next end step, which is this turn's.
# The Gearhulk itself has its printed menace and deathtouch.

